---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const lastUpdated = "August 15, 2024";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Quantum Vista">
    <main class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-gray-950 min-h-screen text-slate-300">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>
            <p
                class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-12 border-b border-gray-800 pb-8"
            >
                Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
                        1. Information We Collect
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        At Quantum Vista, we collect information that you
                        voluntarily provide to us when you register on the
                        website, express an interest in obtaining information
                        about us or our products and services, or otherwise
                        contact us.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-400">
                        <li>
                            <strong class="text-slate-300"
                                >Personal Information:</strong
                            > Names, phone numbers, email addresses, and contact preferences.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong class="text-slate-300"
                                >Automatically Collected Data:</strong
                            > IP addresses, browser characteristics, device IDs, operating
                            systems, language preferences, referring URLs, and information
                            about how and when you use our website.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
                        2. How We Use Your Information
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                        We process your information for purposes based on
                        legitimate business interests, the fulfillment of our
                        contract with you, compliance with our legal
                        obligations, and/or your consent. This includes:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-400">
                        <li>
                            Delivering targeted marketing and promotional
                            campaigns tailored to your interests.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Improving website functionality and user experience.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Responding to user inquiries and offering support.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
                        3. Data Security and Sharing
                    </h2>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed">
                        We use state-of-the-art administrative, technical, and
                        physical security measures to protect your personal
                        information. We only share information with third
                        parties running our infrastructure, such as hosting
                        providers, and never sell your personal data to data
                        brokers.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
                        4. Contact Us
                    </h2>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        If you have questions or comments about this notice, you
                        may email us at <a
                            href="mailto:info@quantumvista.uk"
                            class="text-indigo-400 hover:underline"
                            >info@quantumvista.uk</a
                        > or by post to:
                    </p>
                    <address
                        class="not-italic text-slate-400 border-l-2 border-indigo-500 pl-4 py-2 bg-gray-900/50 rounded-r-lg"
                    >
                        Quantum Vista<br />
                        167-169 Great Portland Street<br />
                        5th Floor, London<br />
                        United Kingdom, W1W 5PF
                    </address>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
